# A screw thread with a chamfered end, through its screen: the
# chamfer's box at the end of the row of the circle's normal, the
# thread made, then undone and made again.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part, and chamfered.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 606 230
twdown L 606 230
twup L 606 230
tw
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
tw
dump
# Undo takes the thread and its chamfer away at once; redo makes them.
key z ctrl
dump
key y ctrl
dump
